  "dct_description_sm": [
    "We drilled firn cores on Devon Ice Cap in 2022 to update the firn record since 2012. In 2012, Bezeau et al. (2013) published their paper on an increase in ice fraction since the beginning of the century. Our data and paper provides an update since 2012 and shows a decrease in ice fraction over the ten year period."
